•our ability to effectively achieve or sustain growth and profitability;

•potential acquisitions and integration of complementary businesses;

•our ability to capture synergies with acquired companies;

•our ability to maintain or strengthen awareness of our brand;

•perceived or actual integrity, reliability, quality or compatibility problems with our products or solutions, including related to unscheduled downtime or outages;

