•our ability to consummate the closing of the Bridg sale and receipt of the proceeds therefrom;

•the impact of macroeconomic developments on our business and operations as well as the business or operations of our FI partners and other third parties with whom we conduct business; and

•other risks detailed below in Item 1A. "Risk Factors."

